## Updating

### Check for Updates

Visit the repository:
```bash
https://github.com/sabirhussain/ai-code-assistance-agents
```

### Update Agents

Re-run the installer to update to the latest version:

```bash
bash <(curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sabirhussain/ai-code-assistance-agents/main/github-agent-install.sh)
```

**What Happens**:
- ✅ Your existing installation is backed up to `~/.copilot.backup-TIMESTAMP/`
- ✅ Latest agent definitions are downloaded
- ✅ Your configuration values are preserved

### Update Only Configuration

Edit directly without reinstalling:

```bash
vim ~/.copilot/config/copilot-config.yml
```

Changes take effect immediately for new agent sessions.

